{"page":451,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"6.4 • 스위치 근거리 네트워크","words":[{"text":"6.4","x":1046,"y":142,"width":42,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":1121,"y":148,"width":13,"height":13},{"text":"스위치","x":1166,"y":144,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"근거리","x":1257,"y":144,"width":79,"height":30},{"text":"네트워크","x":1350,"y":144,"width":107,"height":29}]},{"text":"보안초점","words":[{"text":"보안초점","x":1066,"y":286,"width":173,"height":50}]},{"text":"스위치 랜을 홈쳐보기(sniffing): 스위치 독(poisoning)","words":[{"text":"스위치","x":199,"y":394,"width":90,"height":35},{"text":"랜을","x":302,"y":393,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"홈쳐보기(sniffing):","x":373,"y":393,"width":287,"height":39},{"text":"스위치","x":674,"y":394,"width":89,"height":36},{"text":"독(poisoning)","x":774,"y":394,"width":224,"height":40}]},{"text":"호스트가 스위치에 연결되면 보통 자신을 목적지로 해서 전송된 프레임만 수신한다. 예를 들어","words":[{"text":"호스트가","x":199,"y":458,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"스위치에","x":327,"y":458,"width":114,"height":32},{"text":"연결되면","x":456,"y":457,"width":111,"height":33},{"text":"보통","x":580,"y":458,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"자신을","x":650,"y":457,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"목적지로","x":747,"y":458,"width":111,"height":32},{"text":"해서","x":870,"y":458,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"전송된","x":939,"y":458,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"프레임만","x":1033,"y":459,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"수신한다.","x":1159,"y":459,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"예를","x":1301,"y":461,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"들어","x":1370,"y":460,"width":56,"height":33}]},{"text":"그림 6.17의 스위치 랜에서 호스트 A가 프레임을 호스트 B로 보내고 스위치 테이블에 호스트 B","words":[{"text":"그림","x":199,"y":510,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"6.17의","x":269,"y":510,"width":101,"height":33},{"text":"스위치","x":381,"y":510,"width":85,"height":32},{"text":"랜에서","x":480,"y":510,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"호스트","x":574,"y":511,"width":85,"height":29},{"text":"A가","x":669,"y":510,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"프레임을","x":731,"y":510,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"호스트","x":853,"y":511,"width":85,"height":29},{"text":"B로","x":949,"y":512,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"보내고","x":1007,"y":510,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"스위치","x":1102,"y":510,"width":84,"height":34},{"text":"테이블에","x":1200,"y":511,"width":112,"height":33},{"text":"호스트","x":1323,"y":512,"width":86,"height":30},{"text":"B","x":1421,"y":513,"width":21,"height":29}]},{"text":"에 대한 엔트리가 있으면, 스위치는 프레임을 호스트 a로만 전달한다. 호스트 C가 스니n{(sniff-","words":[{"text":"에","x":201,"y":564,"width":26,"height":31},{"text":"대한","x":240,"y":563,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"엔트리가","x":306,"y":562,"width":116,"height":34},{"text":"있으면,","x":432,"y":562,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"스위치는","x":541,"y":561,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"프레임을","x":663,"y":562,"width":113,"height":33},{"text":"호스트","x":785,"y":563,"width":84,"height":30},{"text":"a로만","x":880,"y":562,"width":77,"height":33},{"text":"전달한다.","x":965,"y":562,"width":122,"height":34},{"text":"호스트","x":1101,"y":563,"width":85,"height":30},{"text":"C가","x":1197,"y":563,"width":53,"height":33},{"text":"스니n{(sniff-","x":1258,"y":563,"width":183,"height":33}]},{"text":"er)를 실행하고 있는 경우, 호스트 C는 A에서 B로 전달되는 프레임을 홍쳐불 수 없다. 따라서 스","words":[{"text":"er)를","x":201,"y":617,"width":70,"height":31},{"text":"실행하고","x":282,"y":616,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"있는","x":409,"y":616,"width":57,"height":32},{"text":"경우,","x":477,"y":615,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"호스트","x":557,"y":616,"width":84,"height":29},{"text":"C는","x":652,"y":615,"width":52,"height":32},{"text":"A에서","x":713,"y":615,"width":78,"height":33},{"text":"B로","x":804,"y":617,"width":49,"height":29},{"text":"전달되는","x":863,"y":615,"width":111,"height":33},{"text":"프레임을","x":982,"y":614,"width":112,"height":34},{"text":"홍쳐불","x":1104,"y":614,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"수","x":1198,"y":615,"width":29,"height":33},{"text":"없다.","x":1238,"y":615,"width":67,"height":33},{"text":"따라서","x":1320,"y":614,"width":83,"height":34},{"text":"스","x":1413,"y":617,"width":30,"height":26}]},{"text":"위치 랜 환경(802.11 랜이나 허브 기반의 이더넷 랜과 같은 브로드캐스트 링크 환경과 달래에서","words":[{"text":"위치","x":200,"y":669,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"랜","x":268,"y":669,"width":27,"height":31},{"text":"환경(802.11","x":307,"y":668,"width":173,"height":33},{"text":"랜이나","x":499,"y":667,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"허브","x":594,"y":667,"width":55,"height":33},{"text":"기반의","x":660,"y":667,"width":82,"height":33},{"text":"이더넷","x":754,"y":667,"width":81,"height":34},{"text":"랜과","x":848,"y":667,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"같은","x":914,"y":667,"width":55,"height":34},{"text":"브로드캐스트","x":979,"y":668,"width":168,"height":33},{"text":"링크","x":1158,"y":667,"width":56,"height":34},{"text":"환경과","x":1224,"y":666,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"달래에서","x":1320,"y":667,"width":121,"height":33}]},{"text":"는 공격자가 프레임을 훔쳐보기 어렵다. 그리나 목적지 주소가 스위치 테이불에 없는 경우 스위치","words":[{"text":"는","x":200,"y":722,"width":28,"height":31},{"text":"공격자가","x":239,"y":721,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"프레임을","x":365,"y":720,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"훔쳐보기","x":491,"y":720,"width":111,"height":33},{"text":"어렵다.","x":615,"y":720,"width":93,"height":33},{"text":"그리나","x":721,"y":721,"width":87,"height":33},{"text":"목적지","x":817,"y":720,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"주소가","x":912,"y":720,"width":85,"height":33},{"text":"스위치","x":1006,"y":720,"width":85,"height":34},{"text":"테이불에","x":1102,"y":719,"width":109,"height":34},{"text":"없는","x":1224,"y":719,"width":56,"height":33},{"text":"경우","x":1291,"y":719,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"스위치","x":1357,"y":719,"width":84,"height":34}]},{"text":"가 프레임을 브로드캐스트하기 때문에 C의 스니퍼는 C를 목적지로 하지 않는 일부 프레임을 홈쳐","words":[{"text":"가","x":200,"y":775,"width":29,"height":32},{"text":"프레임을","x":238,"y":774,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"브로드캐스트하기","x":364,"y":773,"width":227,"height":34},{"text":"때문에","x":603,"y":773,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"C의","x":697,"y":773,"width":50,"height":33},{"text":"스니퍼는","x":757,"y":774,"width":114,"height":33},